What Was Built
We have created FoodRush, a full-stack food delivery application inspired by the usability and functionality of platforms like Swiggy and Zomato, featuring its own original brand identity, custom design system, and full-stack architecture.
Core Architecture & Features Implemented
Storefront & Discovery:
Hero Showcase: High-resolution generated photography with culinary focus, search bar, and delivery guarantees.
Delivery Area Selector: Quick switching between popular hubs (Koramangala, Indiranagar, Bandra West, Connaught Place) or custom delivery addresses.
Cuisine Carousel: Curated categories (Wood-Fired Pizza, Ramen & Asian, Craft Burgers, Macro Bowls, Dum Biryani).
Filtering & Sorting Engine: Pure vegetarian toggle, 4.5+ star ratings filter, price range filters, and sorting by popularity, rating, or delivery speed.
Restaurant Detail & Customizable Menus:
Restaurant Cards & Detail View: Operating status (Open / Closed), key metrics (rating, delivery time, delivery fee, minimum order), and verified customer reviews.
Categorized Menus: Grouped dishes with clear veg/non-veg markers, descriptions, prices, and high-resolution photography.
Item Customization Modal: Support for required & optional add-on groups (crust styles, extra artisan cheeses, noodle firmness, spice levels, sides).
Cart & Server-Side Pricing Verification:
Slide-Over Basket Drawer: Persistent cart with quantity steppers, itemized bills, and single-restaurant order validation with conflict prompt.
Promotional Coupons: Active coupons (RUSH50, WELCOME100, FEAST20, FREEDEL) with 1-click copy and server-side minimum order validation.
Server-Side Totals: Subtotal, delivery fee, 5% GST, and discount recalculated on the backend to prevent client-side price tampering.
Checkout & Multi-Channel Payment Sandbox:
Delivery Address Manager: Save Home, Work, and Other addresses with landmarks and delivery instructions for couriers.
Official Razorpay Sandbox Protocol: Payment order creation and signature verification across UPI (Google Pay / PhonePe / QR), Credit/Debit Cards, Net Banking, and Cash on Delivery (COD).
Live Order Tracking & Order Lifecycle:
Lifecycle Stages: Pending → Confirmed → Cooking → Ready for Pickup → Out for Delivery → Delivered → Cancelled.
Visual Route Simulator: Interactive delivery route visualization with real-time status progression controls and courier contact.
Order History & Reordering: 1-click reorder and post-delivery star rating reviews.
Dedicated Business Portals:
Restaurant Owner Portal (/owner): Live kitchen dispatch queue, operating hours switch, inventory out-of-stock toggles, and new dish creator.
Operations Admin Command (/admin): Platform GMV, 15% platform commissions, restaurant partner registry, promotional coupon manager, and compliance audit trail.
Database & API Architecture:
Express REST API running with Vite dev server on port 3000 (server.ts).
Mongoose schemas (server/models/mongooseSchemas.ts) ready for MongoDB connections, paired with an in-memory/JSON store seeded with restaurants, dishes, and orders.
20-point automated test suite (npm test) verifying pricing math, coupon limits, state transitions, and role permissions.
